 /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9e9bef64b0c9acb8END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-228b43c12a6ed5bcEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_TheApprenticesCompanion5</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_TheApprenticesCompanion5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_TheApprenticesCompanion5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e4a2c320-dc3b-4292-a90f-4b2bed626b81</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e4a2c320-dc3b-4292-a90f-4b2bed626b81\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e4a2c320-dc3b-4292-a90f-4b2bed626b81\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Potentially sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tolna_Tome-Monger\" title=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/25px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/38px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/50px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/25px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tolna_Tome-Monger\" title=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\">Tolna Tome-Monger</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The Particulars of a Single-Entity Plane\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nThis type of alternate plane can easily be used as a trap - think, for example, the infamous <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Djinni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"djinni's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Djinni\">djinni's</a></span> lamp or Magira's Chest trick.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nIn this type of plane, only a single entity may exist at once. If a new entity enters, the old one is quickly and forcefully removed. If no entities are inside, the plane then collapses immediately.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This book references the arcane mechanics behind <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yafeu\" title=\"Yafeu\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Yafeu.png/25px-Portrait_Yafeu.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Yafeu.png/38px-Portrait_Yafeu.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Yafeu.png/50px-Portrait_Yafeu.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yafeu's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Yafeu.png/25px-Portrait_Yafeu.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Portrait_Yafeu.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yafeu\" title=\"Yafeu\">Yafeu's</a> imprisonment in a lamp in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Vault\" title=\"Sorcerous Vault\">Sorcerous Vault</a>.</li>\n<li>This item is part of a series of books about magical phenomenons, creatures and spells:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Apprentice%27s_Companion,_Book_the_First\" title=\"The Apprentice's Companion, Book the First\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Apprentice%27s_Companion,_Book_the_First\" title=\"The Apprentice's Companion, Book the First\">The Apprentice's Companion, Book the First</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Apprentice%27s_Companion,_Book_the_Second\" title=\"The Apprentice's Companion, Book the Second\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Apprentice%27s_Companion,_Book_the_Second\" title=\"The Apprentice's Companion, Book the Second\">The Apprentice's Companion, Book the Second</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Apprentice%27s_Companion,_Book_the_Third\" title=\"The Apprentice's Companion, Book the Third\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Apprentice%27s_Companion,_Book_the_Third\" title=\"The Apprentice's Companion, Book the Third\">The Apprentice's Companion, Book the Third</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Apprentice%27s_Companion,_Book_the_Fourth\" title=\"The Apprentice's Companion, Book the Fourth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for